{"id":"dc82a379ef71435e","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md","title":"Rosser Sentence Construction","display":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction","aliases":["92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction"],"display":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction","depends_on":["[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","[[92-df-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-rosser-sentence-construction — Rosser Sentence Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" href=\"?note=d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" title=\"92-df-rosser-system\">92-df-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (the fixed internal Rosser-provability formula chosen in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variable, free-variable function, and substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\\)</span> (Rosser-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_R\\coloneqq\\neg\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,qquad\n\\theta_R\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_R)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nR\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_R,\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_R\\coloneqq\\neg\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,qquad\n\\theta_R\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_R)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nR\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_R,\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : Rosser句子</li>\n<li>对角引理应用于内部公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R=\\neg\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\">\\(\\theta_R=\\neg\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\)</span>；不把外部证明关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>直接写进对象语言</li>\n<li>展开外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span>的语义后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>表达“每个我的证明码之前都有一个更小的我的否定的证明码”</li>\n<li>Rosser技巧：用证明长度比较替代<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li>在有效可公理化、包含足够算术且相容的系统中，只需普通一致性即可证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R\">\\(\\neg R\\)</span>均不可证</li>\n<li>原先的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}(d(\\ulcorner\\rho\\urcorner))\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}(d(\\ulcorner\\rho\\urcorner))\\)</span>既对非法码无定义，也把外部数值谓词误当成公式；固定点存在性应由对角引理给出</li>\n<li>这是Gödel证明的改进</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep